# Elenda, Saint of Dusk has "hexproof from instants" (CR 702.11d). Stomp, Bonecrusher Giant's Adventure, is an instant
# spell on the stack (CR 715.3), so Bot2 can't target Elenda with it, though the card in hand is a creature card; Stomp
# goes at Bot1 instead (2 damage) and the Giant goes on its adventure to exile.

